{{header player effects}}
'''Temporary buffs''' are [[effects]] applied to the player character that expire after a timed duration or on leaving a room.

<div class="toclimit-2">__TOC__</div>

== Effects ==
Temporary buffs negate all types of damage for a variable amount of time depending on the item it's granted by, including health loss from {{machine|Blood Donation Machine}}s, {{machine|Devil Beggar}}s, and environmental hazards like [[spikes]], {{r|Curse Room}} doors and {{r|Sacrifice Room}}s. '''Do not''' prevent [[Health|Heart Container]] or health loss from [[Pills|Health Down Pills]], {{r|Devil Room}} deals, damage from {{I|IV Bag}}, spawning a [[Babies|baby]], {{dlc|r}} or the door to the {{s|Mausoleum|n}}. End after a set amount of time depending on the source, or when Isaac enters a different room.

